/Title (Government Stakeholder Recommendation Nassau Candy Distributor demonstrates a financially viable core business \(Chocolate/Wonka Bar portfolio\) with a 67.5% division margin. However, regulatory and investment stakeholders should note the concentration risk \(95% profit from one division\) and the presence of near-zero-margin SKUs that may indicate transfer-pricing, cost-allocation, or sourcing inefficiencies requiring review. Immediate product rationalization and a diversification roadmap are recommended within 12 months.)
